{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tutorial will be added in the next update.<br><br>Hello medieval enthusiasts! I\u2019m an solo-independent developer. Every idea, suggestion, or piece of feedback you share will help me shape and improve the game. Let\u2019s develop this game together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of an alchemist-medicus, running your own potion workshop in a medieval town. Brew potions, gather rare ingredients, and tend to an ever-growing line of townsfolk in need of your healing brews.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're refining ancient recipes, crafting new potions, or organizing your shelves with care, each day brings new rhythms to master. Expand your humble infirmary, hire skilled assistants, and adapt to changing demands in a world that rewards both strategy and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From quiet dawns spent gathering herbs to hectic evenings curing the sick, your journey from village healer to legendary medicus begins now.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Craft dozens of unique potions using herbs, minerals, and rare ingredients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Customize and expand your infirmary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Serve a variety of medieval characters, each with unique needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Balance inventory, economy and reputation to grow your business</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Discover new recipes, research upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Relaxing yet strategic gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Isometric art style set in a medieval atmosphere<br><br>contact dev\u00a0<a href=\"mailto:kocafurkandincaslan@gmail.com\">kocafurkandincaslan@gmail.com</a><br>Update 1:    <br>Volume slider added <br>Fixed issue where the game would freeze when running in the background. <br> <br>Update 2:<br>Economy adjusted, potion and area prices 